# Copy to .env (git-ignored). docker compose auto-loads it for ${VAR} interpolation in
# docker-compose.yml AND passes every value here into the container (env_file), where the
# agents Symphony runs can read it. Keep it to the keys this deployment needs.
LINEAR_API_KEY=your-linear-api-key
# Required installation-wide operator credential; generate a high-entropy value, e.g.
# openssl rand -hex 32. Use a different token for each client installation.
SYMPHONY_OPERATOR_TOKEN=
